	(text "Interruption on-time = 0.693us x (RV2 + 150)   0.10ms to 3.57ms\nInterruption off-time = 0.693us x (RV1 + 470)  0.33ms to 35.0ms\n(RV2, RV1 in ohms; C7 = 1uF film)\nBurst rate ~26Hz to ~2.3kHz, duty 0.3% to 92%"
